                ],
                "type": "block_quote"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step-1: Visit the Bank or Insurance Office"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Go to the nearest branch of a bank that offers NAIS or visit the office of an authorized insurance company that provides coverage under NAIS."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "ul_list"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step-2: Fill the Application Form"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Fill out the application form for the National Agriculture Insurance Scheme."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "ul_list"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step-3: Provide Required Documents"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Submit required documents such as:"
